e4c21371f751ca6a79a0c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n The sum of <em>R<sub>D</sub></em> and <em>R<sub>S</sub></em> is _________ kΩ.</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"7.75","high":"8.52"},"solution":"<p>\n 8.25 (7.75 - 8.52)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/02e8e06f6de074f4b062373b3f0adec86b8ce175.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":32,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>\n Three diodes with cut in voltage of 0.7 V each are connected as shown in figure below:</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/f0da15cd8521d9bb502a8cf711f32b7203cf36ee.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n Which of the following option is correct?</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <em>D</em><sub>2</sub> and <em>D</em><sub>3</sub> is forward biased</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <em>D</em><sub>1</sub> and <em>D</em><sub>3</sub> is forward biased</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/0477b7f70ee3b9efac33dad0d9f71730dab7fca3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/f640f46c540f321eb7853dddbdad77aafb2d0a52.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (a)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/cece4e9a2b2222dc71afd2adb39ad164e845290c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":33,"type":"MSQ","correct":"C,D","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n Consider the circuit shown in the figure below:</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/52b873f019089c963cecbacafb177e0158db28c5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n For the BJT, the value of β = 98 and <em>V<sub>BE</sub></em> = 0.7 V.<br />\n Which of the following options are correct?</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/2ee4794c08c656bfd62628d9a5523de4f614beb6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img